<title>NETHERLANDS: Hoogovens details 1996 stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Hoogovens details 1996 stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steel and aluminium maker Hoogovens said on Tuesday it had set the stock alternative to its 1996 final cash dividend at one new share per 29 held.</p>
<p>In March Hoogovens announced it would pay a 1996 cash dividend of 3.00 guilders, unchanged from 1995.</p>
<p>It said on Tuesday, that based on Monday's average share price of 85.30 guilders, the stock dividend was worth 2.94 guilders or 1.95 percent less than the cash dividend.</p>
<p>Payment day had been set for 25 April, Hoogovens added.</p>
<p>Hoogovens shares closed at 85.20 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
